        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86614, Riviera Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Riviera Cabinet Pull is available in a wide range of sizes. This transitional kitchen cabinet pull comes in modern finish color options. The Emtek Riviera Pull will look stunning on most cabinet doors or drawers. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/1-1-4-inch-riviera-square-cabinet-knob-emtek-86612\"><b>Riviera Square Cabinet Knob</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/riviera-rectangular-cabinet-knob-emtek-86613\"><b>Riviera Rectangular Cabinet Knob</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/riviera-appliance-pull-emtek-ap-86621\"><b>Riviera Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Riviera Kitchen Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86614-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262439\"><b>Emtek Riviera Cabinet Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 7 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86614:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86615:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86616:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86617:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"50%\" VALIGN=\"top\" >\r\n<b>EMT-86618:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86619:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86620:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
